:"paragraph","text":"久々のコメント返しきてあーああぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人式なんだ(o^∀^o)ひめたんお祝いの言葉が欲しいなあ↑↑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなっちゃってごめんなさい('・・`)\n昨日は成人の日だったんよね。新成人の方おめでとうございます♪\nうらやましいー。ひめたんも早く成人式参加したいー\n人生のセンパイ!これからの日本を引っ張って行ってくださいな(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな長文読むの「たいぎー」よね？（笑）←使い方あってる？（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使い方はあっとるけど、ひめたんはそんなこと思っとらんよ(ω)\nひめきゅんさんほんまにありがとうございました!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあひめたんは夢叶う矢にお願いするとしたら何をお願いする？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お願いしたいことはいっぱいあるけどー...\nいちばんに何を叶えてもらおっかな。\nもっともっと飛躍したい。ぴょーん(ω)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真に写ってる合格御守はひめたんの高校受験用かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴんぽーん(∀)!\nひめたんにはお守りとひめきゅんのみなさんがついてるから大丈夫♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんって朝は強い方、弱い方？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学1年生～5年生までラジオ体操は皆勤賞、\n8年間9ヶ月の学生生活は無遅刻、\n今まで寝坊なんて無縁だったんですひめたん\n...最近、お仕事するようになってから起きれんくなったけど('・・`)ちーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れない限り毎日コメしてるんだよ！知ってた？\n知らんて言ったら泣くぞY(>_<、)Y"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知っとる!ひめたん知っとるよーお\nだってコメ返めっちゃチェックしよるもん!\nぢゃけ泣かんでー(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログの更新って、一日あたりの上限あるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂はふりーだむ♪\n1日何回更新しても、何日に1回更新しても自由って制度ですー\n運営委員がひそかにカウントしてるって噂ぢゃけどね(//ω//)きゃは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/11/cimg0246_4.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}